WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.916 --> 00:00:32.250
In this verse, Lord Krishna says,

2
00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:35.250
when a person's ignorance is dispelled,

3
00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:38.083
and divine knowledge is attained,

4
00:00:38.083 --> 00:00:41.541
this wisdom spreads within like the sun...

5
00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:45.416
Through this knowledge, one becomes 
familiar with the true nature of the soul.

6
00:00:45.416 --> 00:00:46.333
That person

7
00:00:46.333 --> 00:00:47.833
experiences the divine presence

8
00:00:47.833 --> 00:00:49.916
in every situation.

9
00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:52.458
Their soul becomes enlightened

10
00:00:52.458 --> 00:00:54.083
and is freed from all

11
00:00:54.083 --> 00:00:57.083
worldly illusions.

12
00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:03.625
Can spiritual knowledge

13
00:01:03.625 --> 00:01:08.375
give proper direction to a directionless life?

14
00:01:08.375 --> 00:01:09.875
Lord Krishna answers this question

15
00:01:09.875 --> 00:01:12.375
with great simplicity...

16
00:01:12.375 --> 00:01:14.083
He says...

17
00:01:14.083 --> 00:01:16.791
Imagine you're lost in a dense

18
00:01:16.791 --> 00:01:20.708
and frightening dark forest...

19
00:01:20.708 --> 00:01:24.541
Dense darkness surrounds you... Unclear paths

20
00:01:24.541 --> 00:01:27.541
and fear with uncertainty at every step...

21
00:01:27.541 --> 00:01:29.250
surrounds you...

22
00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:31.958
Then, suddenly, the first ray of sunlight

23
00:01:31.958 --> 00:01:34.541
destroys that darkness...

24
00:01:34.541 --> 00:01:36.916
Everything becomes clear...

25
00:01:36.916 --> 00:01:38.666
All forest paths and

26
00:01:38.666 --> 00:01:40.916
their difficulties too...

27
00:01:40.916 --> 00:01:42.208
Similarly,

28
00:01:42.208 --> 00:01:44.916
the greatest "darkness" in 
human life is ignorance...!!

29
00:01:44.916 --> 00:01:48.958
It prevents one from 
understanding their true nature,

30
00:01:48.958 --> 00:01:50.125
purpose, and

31
00:01:50.125 --> 00:01:51.208
relationship with the divine...

32
00:01:51.208 --> 00:01:53.875
from understanding it.

33
00:01:53.875 --> 00:01:58.375
This is the dense darkness of confusion
 and uncertainties in human life...

34
00:01:58.375 --> 00:02:00.416
This is the cause of all human problems

35
00:02:00.416 --> 00:02:02.458
and suffering...

36
00:02:02.458 --> 00:02:05.750
Spiritual knowledge is that sunlight...

37
00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:06.958
which removes every

38
00:02:06.958 --> 00:02:10.291
confusion and uncertainty in human life...

39
00:02:10.291 --> 00:02:13.500
It introduces a person to the ultimate truth that

40
00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:16.583
they're not just a body...

41
00:02:16.583 --> 00:02:18.666
but an eternal soul...

42
00:02:18.666 --> 00:02:21.083
As soon as the light of spiritual knowledge

43
00:02:21.083 --> 00:02:22.916
is received...

44
00:02:22.916 --> 00:02:25.500
free from the darkness of ignorance,

45
00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:26.666
one clearly sees

46
00:02:26.666 --> 00:02:28.750
their true nature...

47
00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:30.208
Spiritual knowledge is

48
00:02:30.208 --> 00:02:33.333
the compass for the ship of human life...

49
00:02:33.333 --> 00:02:34.166
This wisdom

50
00:02:34.166 --> 00:02:37.125
establishes peace in the human heart, purpose

51
00:02:37.125 --> 00:02:38.500
and clarity in one's relationship

52
00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:41.791
with the divine...

53
00:02:41.791 --> 00:02:42.666
While freeing them

54
00:02:42.666 --> 00:02:44.500
from confusion, wandering,

55
00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:47.000
and stress...

56
00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:50.208
In this verse, Lord Krishna clearly states...

57
00:02:50.208 --> 00:02:56.125
We should strive to attain spiritual knowledge

58
00:02:56.125 --> 00:03:00.083
to remove ignorance and understand our 
true nature and relationship with the divine

59
00:03:05.375 --> 00:03:08.166
"Who am I?"

60
00:03:08.166 --> 00:03:09.750
"What is the purpose

61
00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:12.833
of my life?"

62
00:03:12.833 --> 00:03:14.416
Do such questions

63
00:03:14.416 --> 00:03:17.500
arise in your mind too...?

64
00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:22.125
And when you don't find answers,

65
00:03:22.125 --> 00:03:24.583
the path of life

66
00:03:24.583 --> 00:03:27.083
starts to seem dark...

67
00:03:27.083 --> 00:03:29.833
You feel like a traveler

68
00:03:29.833 --> 00:03:33.666
who has strayed from the path, don't you..?

69
00:03:33.666 --> 00:03:36.500
But why does this happen?

70
00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:39.333
Do you know..?

71
00:03:39.333 --> 00:03:42.083
The reason behind this is

72
00:03:42.083 --> 00:03:44.875
our material nature

73
00:03:44.875 --> 00:03:48.083
and ignorance...

74
00:03:48.083 --> 00:03:49.708
This very ignorance

75
00:03:49.708 --> 00:03:53.375
makes you directionless

76
00:03:53.375 --> 00:03:56.666
and fearful on life's path...

77
00:03:56.666 --> 00:03:59.375
When knowledge is absent,

78
00:03:59.375 --> 00:04:04.208
everything seems uncertain and meaningless.

79
00:04:04.208 --> 00:04:06.583
And this becomes the cause

80
00:04:06.583 --> 00:04:09.666
of sorrow and despair...

81
00:04:09.666 --> 00:04:14.416
As long as we remain confused in 
this darkness of ignorance,

82
00:04:14.416 --> 00:04:17.958
the true purpose of life and

83
00:04:17.958 --> 00:04:20.375
the soul's true nature

84
00:04:20.375 --> 00:04:24.083
remain hidden from our eyes...

85
00:04:24.083 --> 00:04:29.291
Just as night's darkness 
makes everything unclear...

86
00:04:29.291 --> 00:04:31.583
In the same way,

87
00:04:31.583 --> 00:04:35.208
ignorance obscures our true nature and

88
00:04:35.208 --> 00:04:41.208
relationship with the divine...

89
00:04:41.208 --> 00:04:42.708
But,

90
00:04:42.708 --> 00:04:45.125
just as the first ray of sun

91
00:04:45.125 --> 00:04:49.833
destroys the darkness of night...

92
00:04:49.833 --> 00:04:54.083
Similarly, spiritual knowledge

93
00:04:54.083 --> 00:04:58.583
destroys the darkness of our mind...

94
00:04:58.583 --> 00:05:01.333
When you become familiar

95
00:05:01.333 --> 00:05:05.500
with spiritual knowledge, every complexity in life

96
00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:08.375
becomes simple...

97
00:05:08.375 --> 00:05:09.708
You begin to see everything

98
00:05:09.708 --> 00:05:13.375
from a new perspective...

99
00:05:13.375 --> 00:05:18.333
This knowledge not only 
changes your way of thinking.

100
00:05:18.333 --> 00:05:22.208
It gives your existence a new form

101
00:05:22.208 --> 00:05:26.625
and moves life in the right direction...

102
00:05:26.625 --> 00:05:31.541
Therefore, don't remain in the 
confusion of ignorance...

103
00:05:31.541 --> 00:05:34.458
Attain that sun of knowledge,

104
00:05:34.458 --> 00:05:37.791
which will acquaint you with 
your true nature and

105
00:05:37.791 --> 00:05:40.875
the divine.

106
00:05:40.875 --> 00:05:42.750
This is the path

107
00:05:42.750 --> 00:05:47.208
that connects your life to peace, purpose,

108
00:05:47.208 --> 00:05:49.791
and the divine...

109
00:05:54.791 --> 00:05:58.208
Have you ever thought about

110
00:05:58.208 --> 00:06:00.833
what your contribution is to your family

111
00:06:00.833 --> 00:06:04.666
and the next generation..?

112
00:06:04.666 --> 00:06:07.541
Remember, a family doesn't become happy and prosperous

113
00:06:07.541 --> 00:06:10.916
just through material things...

114
00:06:10.916 --> 00:06:15.250
It comes from attaining spiritual knowledge...

115
00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:18.458
That spiritual knowledge which elders

116
00:06:18.458 --> 00:06:21.666
provide to the new generation of the family...

117
00:06:21.666 --> 00:06:24.083
So that every family member

118
00:06:24.083 --> 00:06:26.500
knows the truth of their life...

119
00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:30.666
And the family becomes 
happy and prosperous...

120
00:06:30.666 --> 00:06:32.541
Imagine,

121
00:06:32.541 --> 00:06:34.875
a young person in your family

122
00:06:34.875 --> 00:06:37.083
busy in the race of education

123
00:06:37.083 --> 00:06:39.416
and livelihood...

124
00:06:39.416 --> 00:06:44.166
They have wealth, success, and prestige...

125
00:06:44.166 --> 00:06:46.916
But their soul

126
00:06:46.916 --> 00:06:50.666
is wandering in material pleasures...

127
00:06:50.666 --> 00:06:53.583
When you introduce that young 
person to spiritual

128
00:06:53.583 --> 00:06:56.250
knowledge...

129
00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:59.250
Then they become familiar with 
their life's purpose and

130
00:06:59.250 --> 00:07:03.333
the soul's true nature...

131
00:07:03.333 --> 00:07:06.750
This very knowledge gives them the 
ability in every difficult situation

132
00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:10.583
to make appropriate decisions...

133
00:07:10.583 --> 00:07:11.750
Therefore,

134
00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:14.500
your duty in the family is to

135
00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:19.541
acquaint the new generation 
with spiritual knowledge...

136
00:07:19.541 --> 00:07:24.166
And the young generation 
should also accept that

137
00:07:24.166 --> 00:07:28.208
this knowledge is not a bondage or control...

138
00:07:28.208 --> 00:07:30.291
It is a protective shield,

139
00:07:30.291 --> 00:07:36.083
that gives them the power 
to avoid life's struggles...

140
00:07:36.083 --> 00:07:40.375
This knowledge is not just
 beneficial for one family...

141
00:07:40.375 --> 00:07:43.583
It is for the benefit of the entire society...

142
00:07:43.583 --> 00:07:46.666
As our culture says...

143
00:07:46.666 --> 00:07:49.333
Vasudhaiva Kutumbakam...!

144
00:07:49.333 --> 00:07:51.458
The entire world

145
00:07:51.458 --> 00:07:53.291
is our family...!

146
00:07:58.458 --> 00:08:00.541
Do you know

147
00:08:00.541 --> 00:08:02.833
what the characteristics of strong

148
00:08:02.833 --> 00:08:06.708
and effective leadership are?

149
00:08:06.708 --> 00:08:09.208
Strong and effective leadership doesn't

150
00:08:09.208 --> 00:08:10.583
just mean

151
00:08:10.583 --> 00:08:14.666
giving proper guidance to your organization or

152
00:08:14.666 --> 00:08:19.083
making decisions in their interest...

153
00:08:19.083 --> 00:08:23.291
Strong and effective leadership means that

154
00:08:23.291 --> 00:08:24.791
you empower every member

155
00:08:24.791 --> 00:08:28.875
of your organization completely...

156
00:08:28.875 --> 00:08:33.333
Make them so capable

157
00:08:33.333 --> 00:08:35.916
that they can make decisions themselves...

158
00:08:35.916 --> 00:08:39.958
And solve every problem on their own...

159
00:08:39.958 --> 00:08:43.750
With complete self-confidence
 and understanding...!!!

160
00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:46.916
A powerful leader

161
00:08:46.916 --> 00:08:50.791
doesn't solve all the problems of 
the organization's members...

162
00:08:50.791 --> 00:08:54.583
They make each member capable

163
00:08:54.583 --> 00:08:56.583
of solving their problems

164
00:08:56.583 --> 00:08:59.958
themselves...

165
00:08:59.958 --> 00:09:04.416
Let's understand this with an example...

166
00:09:04.416 --> 00:09:07.666
You are the head of an organization...

167
00:09:07.666 --> 00:09:09.625
And one of your members is having trouble

168
00:09:09.625 --> 00:09:13.416
with time management... So should

169
00:09:13.416 --> 00:09:14.875
you solve their problem

170
00:09:14.875 --> 00:09:18.083
yourself...?

171
00:09:18.083 --> 00:09:21.750
No...!! As a powerful leader,

172
00:09:21.750 --> 00:09:24.416
guide them properly...

173
00:09:24.416 --> 00:09:27.666
Such as determining priorities,

174
00:09:27.666 --> 00:09:29.166
dividing tasks,

175
00:09:29.166 --> 00:09:32.583
and selecting work according to deadlines...

176
00:09:32.583 --> 00:09:33.291
This way

177
00:09:33.291 --> 00:09:37.333
you're not only solving that member's problem...

178
00:09:37.333 --> 00:09:39.958
But you're also making them empowered

179
00:09:39.958 --> 00:09:43.583
and capable of making decisions themselves...

180
00:09:43.583 --> 00:09:47.291
In this way, your image appears as a powerful

181
00:09:47.291 --> 00:09:51.166
and effective leader...

182
00:09:51.166 --> 00:09:54.583
And these very qualities

183
00:09:54.583 --> 00:09:57.916
make you successful in professional life...
